flowchart LR
    subgraph APP[业务服务（Spring Boot）]
    DRUID[Druid DataSource<br/>连接池统计（active/pooling/wait等）]
    MIC[Micrometer MeterRegistry<br/>采集/注册指标]
    ACT[/Actuator Endpoint<br/>/actuator/prometheus/]
    DRUID --> MIC --> ACT
    end

    PROM[Prometheus<br/>按 scrape_interval 拉取] --> TSDB[(Prometheus TSDB<br/>时序存储)]
    ACT -->|HTTP Scrape| PROM
    GRAF[Grafana<br/>Dashboard 面板] -->|PromQL 查询| PROM

    PROM --> RULES[Recording/Alerting Rules（可选）]
    RULES --> AM[Alertmanager（可选）]
    AM --> NOTIF[通知渠道：telegram告警（可选）]
